{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>由 VRMonkey 開發的街機風格卡丁車競速遊戲 Galaxy Kart，現於 Epic Games 平台為 Android 裝置<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，截止時間為 11 月 5 日 23:00（香港時間）。作品以戰鬥與車手個人技術為核心，玩家可在星際賽道上運用角色技能與強化道具爭奪冠軍。</p><p>遊戲背景設定在滿布瘋狂賽手的星系，一場激烈錦標賽將決定誰是最強車手。玩家可選擇不同角色，運用各自獨特技能，並在賽道上拾取強化道具突破對手直達終點。除快速對戰外，亦可參加錦標賽，穿梭於不同星系地圖；Android 版本更支援以手部動作操控，駕駛卡丁車在星際間飛馳。</p><p></p><p>內容方面，Galaxy Kart 收錄 18 條獨特賽道、6 個錦標賽、10 名擁有專屬技能的角色及 9 種強化道具，並設有簡單、普通、困難與挑戰 4 個難度級別。玩家可解鎖新角色與卡丁車自由配搭，亦可與電腦對手較量，或透過 6 人多人模式在線上對戰，並支援語音聊天。</p><p><p></p><p><p></p><p></p><p></p></p></p><figure><p><img alt=\"【Android】星際卡丁車競速 Galaxy Kart 限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/a36b40703ec4bfb8ca215a634dd81b5d2ba4efec1690e00aa301a4f1ba97abce/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fnewmobilelife_722%2F1b96ceabc9a1794e96dc402b2c312529.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></figure><figure><p><img alt=\"【Android】星際卡丁車競速 Galaxy Kart 限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/640d83ac15d5c9a28fd054b9c4f8bebe7f5d28888685855380b2c87db717753d/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fnewmobilelife_722%2Fa0103592242b70f2b717665df6d349ff.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></figure><figure><p><img alt=\"【Android】星際卡丁車競速 Galaxy Kart 限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/1f44fd9d8702eee411d484d3761ba1b26388aa48bbc1e437a6fa724f41362453/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fnewmobilelife_722%2Fc5f583e1260ad7ed7f4ea94217d64060.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></figure><figure><p><img alt=\"【Android】星際卡丁車競速 Galaxy Kart 限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"541\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/f19c8a3f19efa9210e89a93d6b1bff5d095b43cccb07c64d73d78d3e363abbb3/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fnewmobilelife_722%2F86d78b13d35c025e90a6fdf5fe4072f2.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></figure><p>遊戲名稱：Galaxy Kart<br/>支援平台：Android<br/>領取位置：<a href=\"https://store.epicgames.com/p/galaxy-kart-android-135821\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Epic Games</a></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T16:21:21.938181+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":455,"images":4,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T15:50:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T04:39:01.481030+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T16:18:30.816099+00:00","content_hash":"a726e3fc10cb4a3513b7d56983281ac5f837bd04e2c7b9846fa0a3d064009658","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}